'''Rhubarb Seeds''' are a type of seed. Mature plants yield [[Rhubarb]].

They can be purchased at the [[Oasis]] and occasionally from the [[Traveling Cart]]. They can also be obtained by using the [[Seed Maker]].  Five to twenty Rhubarb Seeds may occasionally be found in [[Skull Cavern#Treasure Rooms|treasure rooms]] in the Skull Cavern. Rhubarb may also grow from [[Mixed Seeds]] planted on [[Ginger Island]].

